It is now four o'clock in the afternoon.
I am working on the computer.
I feel a little tired.
I stand up from the chair.
I am walking to the office pantry.
There is nobody there now.
The pantry is very quiet.
I am making a cup of tea.
I take a cup and a tea bag.
I pour hot water into the cup.
I add a little sugar.
I am looking outside.
I drink the hot tea slowly.
I am resting for a little while.
The tea tastes good.
Now I feel refreshed.
I am walking back to my desk.
